  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to request that VRChat take stronger action against users who intentionally engage in ragebaiting, coordinated harassment, and false accusations against innocent players.\n\nThere are situations where individuals deliberately spread misinformation or make false claims to provoke others into attacking, reporting, or ostracizing someone who has done nothing wrong. This kind of behavior can quickly escalate into mob harassment, damage a person’s reputation, and create an unsafe environment within the community.\n\nI encourage VRChat to investigate reports thoroughly using available evidence, such as chat logs, moderation records, and other relevant information, before taking enforcement action. Users who knowingly make false accusations or coordinate harassment against others should also be held accountable when there is clear evidence of misconduct.\n\nI appreciate the work the moderation team does to keep VRChat safe, and I hope continued efforts can help reduce targeted harassment while ensuring that innocent users are protected from coordinated abuse.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.",
